15
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:53,518
Five layouts, eight styles, star ratings.

16
00:00:53,602 --> 00:00:56,480
Lightweight, accessible and mobile ready.

17
00:00:56,600 --> 00:00:59,445
Ultimate 3D Testimonial Slider.

18
00:00:59,553 --> 00:01:01,963
